<title>INDIA: Malaysian Prime Minister Mahathir to visit India.</title>
<headline>Malaysian Prime Minister Mahathir to visit India.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian Prime Minister Mahathir Mohamad will arrive in the Indian capital on Thursday to begin a three-day visit, a government statement said.</p>
<p>Mahathir will meet Indian President Shankar Dayal Sharma, Prime Minister H.D. Deve Gowda and Foreign Minister I.K. Gujral during his visit, it said.</p>
<p>He was also scheduled to deliver a lecture on India's relationship with the ASEAN trade bloc, it added.</p>
</text>
